{"articleNo":"983","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=983&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[취업] 2009년 교육역량강화사업 해외인턴십 참가자 모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.11.19","hit":"11159","attachments":[{"name":"2009년 교육역량강화사업 해외인턴십 계획.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=983&attachNo=70301"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#333399\" size=\"3\">2009년 교육역량강화사업 해외인턴십 참가자 모집<br></font><br><br><br>1. 해외인턴십 대상국가 및 모집인원</span>\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">가. 대상국가 : 일본</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 선발인원 : 30명</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">2. 지원자격</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">가. 금오공대 재학생 및 졸업생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 해외인턴 교육기관에서 연속적으로 3개월 이상 교육을 받은 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 해외인턴 근무가 1개월 이상 가능한 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 일본어 가능자로 JLPT 3급 이상 자격소지자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 한국 국적자로 심신이 건강하고 병역 등 해외파견에 결격사유가 없는 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;바. 전공 및 성별무관</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">※ 단, 기 해외인턴십 지원사업으로 파견하였던 자는 선발대상에서 제외</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3. 해외인턴십 특전</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 해외인턴십 종료 후 일본현지 기업체 정규직 취업알선 및 각종 취업정보 제공</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 재학생은 우리대학교 ‘해외인턴십’규정에 의거 학점인정(문의처 : 국제교류센터)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 경비지원 : 교육역량강화사업 예산범위내에서 지원(2009년 기준 1인당 200만원 이내)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 학점인정관련 자세한 사항은 본교 국제교류센터(교 7215, 7243)에 문의하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4. 지원절차</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#0000ff\"><strong>가. 신청접수 :</strong></font></span><font color=\"#0000ff\"><strong><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2009년 11월 16일(월) ∼ 2009년 12월 15(화) 18:00까지</span></strong></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;<font color=\"#0000ff\">&nbsp;<strong>나. 제출서류</strong></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;- 해외인턴십 참가신청서 (서식 1)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 해외인턴십 계획서 (서식 2)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 성적증명서 및 주민등록등본 각 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 일본어능력성적표, 교육이수증명서, 자격증사본 각 1부<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 해외인턴십 참가신청서 및 계획서 양식은 첨부파일 <strong>해외인턴십 계획 </strong>참조<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br>&nbsp;[해외인턴십 최종합격자 제출서류]</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">- 해외인턴십 지원금신청서 (서식 3)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">여권 및 항공권사본 각 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 서약서 (서식 4)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 보호자동의서 (서식 5)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;[해외인턴십 현지도착 후 제출서류]&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;- 해외인턴십 도착확인원 (서식 6) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">(현지도착 후 10일이내 취업정보센터 제출)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;[해외인턴십 종류 후 제출서류]&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">- 해외인턴십 근무확인원 (서식 7)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">(해외인턴십 종료후 입국일로부터 10일이내 취업정보센터 제출)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 제 출 처 : 금오공과대학교 취업정보센터(도서관 2층)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 제출방법 : 접수기간 내에 본인직접 취업정보센터로 서류제출</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">5. 추진일정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">가. 신청서접수&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; : 2009. 11. 16(월) ~ 2009. 12. 15(화) 18:00까지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 해외인턴십 선발면접&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; : 2009. 12. 17(목) 14:00 잡카페</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 합격자발표&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; : 2009. 12. 18(금) 14:00 취업정보센터 홈페이지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 최종합격자 서류제출&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; : 2009. 12. 23(수) 18:00까지 취업정보센터로 제출</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 오리엔테이션&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 2009. 12. 29(화) 14:00 취업정보센터</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;바. 해외인턴십 도착확인원 제출 : 도착일로부터 10일이내 취업정보센터로 제출</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;사. 해외인턴십 근무확인원 제출 : 입국일로부터 10일이내 취업정보센터로 제출</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br>6. 합격자선발</span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">(해외인턴십 신청자 중 면접에 의해 최종합격자를 선발)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 면접일시/장소 : 2009. 12. 17(목) 14:00 잡카페</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 면접위원 : 기획협력처장, 취업정보센터소장, HRD센터소장</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 면접방법 :</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"> 면접위원이 수험번호 순으로 개인 또는 그룹별 면접&nbsp; 실시</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 평가기준</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"69\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"67\" rowspan=\"2\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">총점</span></p>\n          